{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_2000_situation", "source_sha256": "8d03dae306e8a1e68fd81989dce9d6f3e21fde51778137dc7562cb1ad7e0e407", "ja": "動物番組のお仕事", "zh": "动物节目工作", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_2000_place", "source_sha256": "8a3122e45b14e571a445235aa3b24dbbaa744000fa64cc905ff7ae7a98bcb6f5", "ja": "動物園", "zh": "动物园", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_2001_040tam", "source_sha256": "ce8b34fa52a67b7b307536412117d79a1c7810be1abfcb207e4b7693709612bd", "ja": "おやぶんっ！　見て、あそこにライオンがいる！\nクマとどっちが強いかな？", "zh": "老大！你看，那边有狮子！\n不知道狮子和熊，谁比较强呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_2002_040tam", "source_sha256": "2b6aa9da7f77ba50a7e7b4c6f5dbbb62786bcb06ef4d3ae75061df40dcfec1ea", "ja": "あっ、あっちにはウシがいるぞっ！\nねえねえ、おやぶん、なでて来てもいい？", "zh": "啊，那边有牛耶！\n欸欸，老大，环可以去摸摸牠吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_2003_p", "source_sha256": "c41b37499cb41a3a551005898482fb11239c3158f053f89ab8636883170dee14", "ja": "こらこら……。今日は遊びに来たんじゃないぞ、環？\nこれからお仕事だってこと、忘れないようにな。", "zh": "喂喂……今天可不是来玩的喔，环。\n别忘了接下来可是要工作啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_2004_040tam", "source_sha256": "62128f92f69a484f23615da892c1ee8c7b1029af265f08ad39ad7f9bff80cef6", "ja": "あ、そうだった！　リポートっていうのやるんだよね！\nたまき、動物園のお仕事、頑張るぞ～！", "zh": "啊，对耶！是要「报导」对吧！\n动物园的工作，环会好好加油喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_2005_040tam", "source_sha256": "0aebb79830c6ee60ca4ac875ed37900cc1c8949f8e3a2e178c05410505f20924", "ja": "お仕事終わったら、いっぱい遊ぼうね、おやぶん！\nカエルとか、いるかな～。くふふっ♪", "zh": "工作结束之后，一起玩个过瘾吧，老大！\n不知道有没有青蛙呢～呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
